     1353   MAIN-BLOCK:
     1354   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     1355      ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
